 },
 "summary": "A three-conductor (tip, ring, sleeve) socket for a 3.5 mm plug, soldered flat on the board. The housing is 14.5 mm long, 6 mm wide and 5 mm tall, with two Ø1.5 mm locating posts on its underside. SJ-3523 has three contacts and no switch; SJ-3524 adds a fourth contact that touches the tip spring until a plug goes in. It is rated 12 Vdc and 1 A, with 50 mΩ maximum contact resistance, over -25 to 85 °C, and comes on 1,000-piece reels.",
